# Validation

Choose the smallest validation that proves a change. Prefer existing build,
type, lint, test, schema, and documentation checks owned by the affected scope.
If a required check cannot run, report the reason and the remaining unverified
risk.

For every new or renamed identifier, path, command, configuration key, API
concept, persisted name, UI label, or documentation term, apply
`.agents/shared/naming.md`. Confirm that one plain project term describes the
capability or responsibility consistently. Flag public, persisted, or external
name changes and their migration or compatibility plan before applying them.

